/-! Frozen target: the window of
`Paper16AccessibilityMilestoneFreshCarrierTargetsV2.FrontLiteralWindowTyping` with the rows of
`TypedCarrierComputability` attached (`lem:arithmetic-accessibility`; assembly, section 2 of
`verification/local-fable-trio-2026-11-27/fableB3/TYPED-COMPUTABILITY-MAP.md`; Fable B3,
27 November 2026).

`FrontLiteralWindowRows` is `FrontLiteralWindowTyping` word for word (generated by script from
that module, which is untouched), with two more conjuncts under `∀ c`:

* `GeneralSeedLeast A c` — K2 for arbitrary scalar carriers on this window;
* `NeutralReducts A c → GroundNotLambda A c → LambdaReducts A L₀ U c → LambdaInstances A L₀ U c →
  AllTerms A c` — the all-terms sentence from the four open rows of
  `Paper16AccessibilityMilestoneTypedRowsTargetsV2`, at the window's own `L₀` and beta instance
  program `U`.

So on this window what remains of the lemma is the four named rows. Not claimed: any of the
four rows, `TypedCarrierComputability`, `AllTerms`, `lem:arithmetic-accessibility`. -/

